name=ViewDoctor | Health Overhaul for Project Zomboid/Viewpoint
id=ViewDoctor
description=Healing minigames for Project Viewpoint. Stitching, bandaging, disinfecting, splinting, pulling out glass and bullets, injections, and The Only Cure's amputation, cauterizing and wound cleaning each become a mouse minigame. In first person your character raises the treated limb into view and the wound and tools are 3D models on it; in isometric view the game is drawn on a flat limb. Clothing over the wound comes off first and goes back on after. Works with Extensive Health Rework Evolved, The Only Cure and Fancy/Brutal Handwork.
